title: Streetfighting Comes to an End
subtitle: Paramilitaries are a thing of the past.
view-if: chancellor == "Staal" and staal_post_time >= 10 and state_force >= 70
max-visits: 1
new-page: true
tags: event
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/blutmai_3.jpg";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);      
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

= Streetfighting Over

With the Commonwealth Army being deployed to quell political violence, streetfighting between the rivaling paramilitaries have died down in intensity, and the situation is effectively resolved.

The days of the street armies are behind us.

- @streetfighting_joever

@streetfighting_joever
title: So be it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.streetfighting_joever = 1;

Q.staal_portrait = 1;

Q.pro_republic += 10;
Q.staal_approval += 1;
!}
go-to: root
